OL,3,GNEWSAI had to explain to my teacher
OL,4,Awhat a young carer was - we need more
OL,5,Asupport
OL,6,
OL,7,FNeraya is only 15 but cannot remember a
OL,8,Ftime when she was not a carer for her
OL,9,Ftwo sisters.
OL,11,FShe is among the young carers crying
OL,12,Fout for what they have called crucial
OL,13,Fsupport, with Neraya saying she has
OL,14,Feven had to explain what she does to
OL,15,Fher teachers.
OL,17,FThe Welsh government has announced a
OL,18,Fnational strategy for unpaid carers,
OL,19,Fwith seven priorities including earlier
OL,20,Frecognition and mental health support.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
